From: Hunter B Hough <git@hough.ink>
Date: Sun, 31 May 2026 14:59:08 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 05/19] chore: fork patch-management, upgrade tooling, and
 anvil install guards

Squashed fork-local build/deploy plumbing:
- patch-management system (make patches/upgrade)
- skip origin/main staleness check on anvil branch
- pre-push hook auto-refreshes patches/
- upgrade-anvil.sh guided upstream upgrade

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
